From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Contributor <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:30:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(plugins/jxl): text over a photo stays exact, the
 photo under it lossy

Where certified plain text meets a photo, the export is drawn once more
with the css export option making its text transparent. The samples that
differ are the text, kept exact; the photo under it takes the quality.
